-- Input: A 3x3 matrix $M$ with elements $m_{ij}$ [S1, unofficial].
-- Input: Rotation parameters $c$ (cosine) and $s$ (sine) [S1, unofficial].
-- Output: Modified 3x3 matrix $M'$ with specific elements transformed [S1, unofficial].
